{"root_text": {"uid": "ja78", "author": "Mahāsaṅgīti Tipiṭaka Buddhavasse 2500", "author_short": "ms", "author_uid": "ms", "lang": "pli", "title": "Illisajātaka", "previous": {"author_uid": "ms", "lang": "pli", "name": "The Great Dreams ", "uid": "ja77"}, "next": {"author_uid": "ms", "lang": "pli", "name": "A Harsh Drum ", "uid": "ja79"}}, "translation": {"uid": "ja78", "lang": "en", "author_uid": "sujato", "author": "Bhikkhu Sujato", "author_short": "sujato", "title": "The Two Illisas ", "previous": {"author_uid": "sujato", "lang": "en", "name": "The Great Dreams ", "uid": "ja77"}, "next": {"author_uid": "sujato", "lang": "en", "name": "A Harsh Drum ", "uid": "ja79"}}, "segmented": true, "suttaplex": {"acronym": "Ja 78", "alt_acronym": null, "volpages": "PTS 1.353", "alt_volpages": null, "uid": "ja78", "blurb": "“Both squint.”—This story was told by the Master while at Jetavana, about a miserly Lord High Treasurer. Hard by the city of Rajagaha, as we are told, was a town named Jagghery, and here dwelt a certain Lord High Treasurer, known as the Millionaire Miser, who was worth eighty crores! Not so much as the tiniest drop of oil that a blade of grass will take up, did he either give away or consume for his own enjoyment. So he made no use of all his wealth either for his family or for sages and brahmins: it remained unenjoyed,—like a pool haunted by demons. Now, it fell out on a day that the Master arose at dawn moved with a great compassion, and as he reviewed those ripe for conversion throughout the universe, he became aware that this Treasurer with his wife some four hundred miles away were destined to tread the Paths of Salvation.", "difficulty": null, "original_title": "Illisajātaka", "root_lang": "pli", "root_lang_name": "Pāli", "type": "leaf", "from": null, "translated_title": "The Two Illisas ", "translations": [{"lang": "de", "lang_name": "Deutsch", "is_root": false, "author": "Sabbamitta", "author_short": "sabbamitta", "author_uid": "sabbamitta", "publication_date": null, "id": "ja78_translation-de-sabbamitta", "segmented": true, "title": "Hering, der Geizhals ", "volpage": null, "has_comment": true}, {"lang": "en", "lang_name": "English", "is_root": false, "author": "Bhikkhu Sujato", "author_short": "sujato", "author_uid": "sujato", "publication_date": null, "id": "ja78_translation-en-sujato", "segmented": true, "title": "The Two Illisas ", "volpage": null, "has_comment": true}, {"lang": "pli", "lang_name": "Pāli", "is_root": true, "author": "Mahāsaṅgīti Tipiṭaka Buddhavasse 2500", "author_short": "ms", "author_uid": "ms", "publication_date": null, "id": "ja78_root-pli-ms", "segmented": true, "title": null, "volpage": null, "has_comment": false}, {"lang": "ca", "lang_name": "Català", "is_root": false, "author": "Jambudipa", "author_short": "Jambudipa", "author_uid": "jambudipa", "publication_date": "2014", "id": "ca_ja78_jambudipa", "segmented": false, "volpage": null, "has_comment": false}, {"lang": "de", "lang_name": "Deutsch", "is_root": false, "author": "Dr. Julius Dutoit", "author_short": "Dutoit", "author_uid": "dutoit", "publication_date": "2007", "id": "de_ja78_dutoit", "segmented": false, "volpage": null, "has_comment": false}, {"author": "Robert Chalmers", "author_short": "Chalmers", "author_uid": "chalmers", "has_comment": false, "id": "en_ja78_chalmers", "is_root": false, "lang": "en", "lang_name": "English", "publication_date": "1895", "segmented": false, "volpage": null, "title": "Illisa Jātaka"}, {"lang": "jpn", "lang_name": "日本語", "is_root": false, "author": "関西パーリ語実習会", "author_short": "関西パーリ語実習会", "author_uid": "kansai", "publication_date": "2023", "id": "jpn_ja78_kansai", "segmented": false, "volpage": null, "has_comment": false}, {"lang": "si", "lang_name": "සිංහල", "is_root": false, "author": "A.P. de Zoysa", "author_short": "Zoysa", "author_uid": "zoysa", "publication_date": null, "id": "si_ja78_zoysa", "segmented": false, "volpage": null, "has_comment": false}], "parallel_count": 0, "biblio"